        "subject": "LU-20760 lnet: forward ko2iblnd module options",
        "message": "LU-20760 lnet: forward ko2iblnd module options\n\nThe ko2iblnd install helper dropped command-line module options, so\ntest_310 could not set its timeout.\nPass $CMDLINE_OPTS to ko2iblnd-probe as arguments and forward them\nto modprobe using \"$@\".\n\nAssisted-By: Codex 5.6-Sol\nTest-Parameters: trivial env=ONLY=310 testlist=sanity-lnet\nFixes: 70b96b22d71b (\"LU-6735 lnet: select appropriate optimization options for ko2iblnd\")\nSigned-off-by: Manish Regmi <mregmi@ddn.com>\nChange-Id: I26142f11566bf35039446b27fc8006a97bb672e4\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/68937\nReviewed-by: Chris Horn <chorn@ddn.com>\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Cyril Bordage <cbordage@whamcloud.com>\n"
